{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>本周二（8月11日）凌晨4時許，元朗水邊圍邨陷入大停電，7樓大廈中，僅康水樓一幢維持電力供應，影響水邊圍邨及附近逾千人的電力供應，冷氣及風扇停轉，居民在睡夢中熱醒，中電經搶修後，當日上午10時45分為所有受影響客戶恢復電力，將調查事故原因。</p><p>但到了當晚大約10時49分，警方接報指，水邊圍邨多幢大廈再度停電，消防同晚10時30分起接獲元朗區有3宗困𨋢報告。去到同晚大約11時43分，大廈陸續復電。</p><p>許多網民在社交媒體「悲報」，慨嘆「又停電」、「唔怪得岩先個冷氣都唔凍」、「天橋都無電」，更有人指再次「又係得康水樓冇事」。《香港01》記者正趕赴現場視察。</p><figure><img alt=\"有網民指再次「又係得康水樓冇事」。（Threads@ruo99688圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260811/1163989168796209152136092.jpeg/5KhssfXlC1yD3sTRkA-WM3Y__-91MDBzBlUh6wZVIes\"/><figcaption>有網民指再次「又係得康水樓冇事」。（Threads@ruo99688圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"當晚11時10分，天文文台錄到元朗公園有30.5度高溫。（天文台）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260811/1163990055811813376376914.jpeg/pKF5ghMI7MHOmQN2yVDBvdu553pZZ8gFURTg_FEU4Pw\"/><figcaption>當晚11時10分，天文文台錄到元朗公園有30.5度高溫。（天文台）</figcaption></figure><p>▼8月11日凌晨和早上停電情況▼</p><figure><img alt=\"消防接報到場。（threads：wwwlkh影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260811/1163764131535261696478126.png/W8ab3ubMji5lU8xBOBe9Yxt9c611t5qikXE0JpFxNCY\"/><figcaption>消防接報到場。（threads：wwwlkh影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防接報到場。（threads：wwwlkh影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260811/1163764133938728960548930.png/xfy1fFmLrMoD8AblRl-QCniKoShQm4TvmR7J4pkeyeI\"/><figcaption>消防接報到場。（threads：wwwlkh影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"中電人員到場維修。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260811/1163765655317516288321657.jpeg/qFjtZJr1KYiakqP4tJy0dPRb7MWtMP44H95wbDrecGw\"/><figcaption>中電人員到場維修。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"中電人員到場維修。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260811/1163765659503562752164275.jpeg/ZD7FqYZd1wIJaYCKXlkTZ_JXhTu3xs2jYgkLOEcJCzg\"/><figcaption>中電人員到場維修。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"中電人員到場維修。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260811/1163765663425368064354709.jpeg/OW9B6o5To1sffBVlZVPGjPxZHZuuOksnDUK7wihCu8I\"/><figcaption>中電人員到場維修。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"中電人員到場維修。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260811/1163765665916915712561379.jpeg/nFH8LVxaZA0asl0mIITDxDuGLnzziAFJH7torzq7aK8\"/><figcaption>中電人員到場維修。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"電梯全部停運。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260811/1163765669234741248948560.jpeg/kD-ZjGAgeluqM_j6LUA5gLxtFiwGAmCQS9kvt27ZL7c\"/><figcaption>電梯全部停運。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是水邊圍邨。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260811/1163765643317612544891670.jpeg/6mNx66pHbkmpuZZYQx66bqSF7vxze6jc3bQNQfi0DUE\"/><figcaption>現場是水邊圍邨。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-11T15:59:18.233655+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":514,"images":10,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}